IONMIX EOS/Opacity Tables
-------------------------

IONMIX4 format equation-of-state and opacity tables (.cn4 files) are
included in the FLASH distribution and are governed by the FLASH
License Agreement. This package therefore does **not** redistribute
FLASH-distributed tables (e.g. `*-imx-*.cn4`, such as `he-imx-005.cn4`
or `polystyrene-imx-008.cn4`).

The package **does** redistribute user-generated IONMIX tables
(`Z*.cn4`, produced by the PhySimX `gen_eos_op` / IONMIX workflow from
publicly available IONMIX data), which carry no FLASH-license
restriction. These are required by the shipped scenarios (referenced
via `DATAFILES` in their `Config` files).


